  <h1>Buccal and IntraOral + Facial Sculpting Massage</h1>
  <span class="image main"><img src="images/face.webp" alt="Buccal massage and facial sculpting treatment" /></span>

  <p>At Five Stones, it's more than just a Buccal Massage- it also includes facial sculpting (known as the non-surgical face lift) via facial Gua Sha, cupping and lymphatic drainage.</p>

  <p>This 60 minutes of bliss is therapeutic and also cosmetic.</p>

  <h2>This treatment is beneficial if you experience:</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Jaw Pain/TMJ Discomfort</li>
    <li>Teeth Grinding and/or Clenching</li>
    <li>Headaches or Migraines</li>
    <li>Facial Tension/Adhesions Pulling Downward</li>
    <li>Swelling/Puffiness in the Face</li>
    <li>Neck Pain</li>
    <li>Anxiety</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Sometimes we store emotions and trauma in our jaws, and I am here to hold space and help process if that happens. In addition to the therapeutic benefits of releasing tight muscles, eliminating tension and adhesions that pull the skin down allows us to achieve a lifted and relaxed appearance. The cupping and Gua Sha increase circulation, adding radiance and firmness that can diminish fine lines and wrinkles. With repeated sessions (4-7 weekly treatments might be recommended based on age and skin type) we can see improved skin thickness from the accumulated efforts. Arrive with a fresh, clean face and love the skin you are in again!</p>

  <p>People in their 20's are doing this preventatively so they don't develop holding patterns and adhesions in their neck, jaw and facial muscles that pull downward. Men can enjoy this as well- they just need to be clean-shaven. My personal favorite is how the cupping on the lips makes them plumped up and everything feels firm and looks snatched.</p>

